<item>
            <title>[LU-20724] tests: fsx burst mode and client cache drop option</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20724</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;fsx has no way to run a burst of operations on one mountpoint before switching, and no way to force the client to drop its cache.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add -I burst&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;:maxops&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; to do 1 to maxops operations on one path before switching.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add -k P for a 1 in P chance per operation of sync plus cancelling unused DLM locks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
